CommitDate: Sat Nov 7 21:37:36 2026 +0000

    Report malformed case documents in the generated index
    
    Review of 1401bd9 found that an unguarded stderr diagnostic could abort
    reconcile on a failing stderr, leaving the index stale. Replace the console
    diagnostic with a durable 'malformed' list in the generated index: no stderr
    dependency, no new failure mode, and a malformed case-like document stays
    visible to monitoring instead of disappearing. Regression covers detection,
    non-indexing, a failing stderr (2>/dev/full), and recovery once the malformed
    file is removed.

